[{"answer":"Today the sun was warm;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/1.mp3"},{"answer":"the sky was blue with a few white clouds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/2.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a good day to pick strawberries;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/3.mp3"},{"answer":"it was a good day to go to the beach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I drove to a pick-your-own farm where people can pick their own fruit and buy it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/5.mp3"},{"answer":"There the fruit is very fresh and delicious.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/6.mp3"},{"answer":"The owner of the farm gave everyone a row to pick their strawberries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Everyone was wearing sun hats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I knelt down on the straw between the rows","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/9.mp3"},{"answer":"and picked the big juicy red berries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I tasted one; it was warm from the sun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/11.mp3"},{"answer":"When I bit into it the juice was sweet and strong.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/12.mp3"},{"answer":"When three big pails were full, I went to pay for them","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and picked up some recipes for some strawberry desserts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I packed two of the pails in a cooler with some ice,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/15.mp3"},{"answer":"and the other one we would eat at the beach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I met my daughter at the beach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/17.mp3"},{"answer":"She had a soft pink blanket on the sand.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/18.mp3"},{"answer":"This beach is beside a lake,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and across the lake about 50 kilometers away","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/20.mp3"},{"answer":"the large city can sometimes be seen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Today the wind blew cooler air across the lake over the people on the beach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/22.mp3"},{"answer":"There were children playing in the water.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/23.mp3"},{"answer":"One man helped his son dig holes in the sand,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and the water ran into the holes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/25.mp3"},{"answer":"One lady held her children's hands and walked down into the water.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Families climbed over the rocks","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/27.mp3"},{"answer":"and sat on the last rock where the water was deep.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Teenagers rode bicycles and roller blades along the path beside the beach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Adults walked and ran along this path,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/30.mp3"},{"answer":"carrying water bottles around their waists.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/31.mp3"},{"answer":"We sat on the blanket and ate sandwiches of meat and lettuce and strawberries from the pail.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/32.mp3"},{"answer":"We talked and read books and lay in the sun, relaxing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/33.mp3"},{"answer":"We wore sunscreen, but our skin was getting hot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/34.mp3"},{"answer":"How cold was the water?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/35.mp3"},{"answer":"We walked across the sand that almost burned our feet, to the edge of the water.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/36.mp3"},{"answer":"She went right in and lay down floating.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I put my toes in and felt the chill through my body.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/38.mp3"},{"answer":"I went up to my knees, then my thighs, but that was far enough!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/39.mp3"},{"answer":"My whole body was cooled down;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I headed back to the blanket to lay in the sun again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Soon it was time to go home,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/42.mp3"},{"answer":"she was coming to my house for supper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/43.mp3"},{"answer":"We drove down the highway with the windows open","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/44.mp3"},{"answer":"and our hair blowing in the warm breeze.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/45.mp3"},{"answer":"We cut the strawberries up and made a strawberry dessert with cake and ice cream.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/46.mp3"},{"answer":"We sat outside in the backyard under the maple trees","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/47.mp3"},{"answer":"with the birds singing around us and ate our supper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/48.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a perfect ending to a relaxing summer day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/144-a-summer-sunday-2019-04-07-04-28-38/49.mp3"}]
